{"id":"auberge","lemma":"auberge","pos":"noun","rank":3531,"glosses":["hostel","prison"],"ipa":"/o.bɛʁʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/Fr-auberge.ogg/Fr-auberge.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"auberges"},"formAudio":{"auberges":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-auberges.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tu n'es pas sorti de l'auberge.","en":"You're not out of the woods.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to exit","l":"sortir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous ne sommes pas encore sortis de l'auberge.","en":"We're not out of the woods yet.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"to exit","l":"sortir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"not yet"]]},{"text":"C'est l'auberge espagnole.","en":"You get out only what you put in.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"Spanish","l":"espagnol"}]},{"text":"Nous les rencontrâmes à l'auberge de jeunesse.","en":"We met them at the youth hostel.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"to meet","l":"rencontrer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"youth"}]},{"text":"Un feu a démarré à l'auberge où ils étaient.","en":"A fire broke out at the inn where they were staying.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"fire"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to start","l":"démarrer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"where"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"}]}]}